// # Hostile extra print beside if-true no-else
//
// Logline: Print fold-me then other so emit-wasm must miss a noelse-only fold.
//
// Setup: One public main. Extra println after the if.
//
// Beats:
//   1. If true print fold-me.
//   2. Then print other.
//   3. A fold-me-only module is a lie.

pub fn main() {
    if true {
        println("fold-me");
    }
    println("other");
}
